# JOIN THE ULTIMATE DANCE PARTY WITH THE AFRICAN CHILDREN’S CHOIR!

Tuesday June 23rd 6-7pm @ Coolum Civic Centre This is a Zumba class not to be missed! Enjoy a fun and invigorating workout at this Zumba Gold dance class, alongside 18 amazing kids from the internationally renowned African Children’s Choir. Zumba Gold is a ‘feel happy’ dance class combining high-energy and motivating music such as salsa, hip hop, swing and Bollywood, with modified low-impact moves and easy to follow choreography. This will be a fun night as you not only get to raise funds for the ongoing education of these amazing young kids, but you get to groove to the music with them as well. And boy can they move! Tell all your friends and let’s get this dance party happening! Tickets at the door: $10 adults, $8 children.
